---
description: Finance domain rules (MXN, Banorte credit cards)
globs: src/finance/**,src/pages/Money.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---
- Currency MXN, format with mxn() (es-MX). Transaction.amount is signed: + inflow, − outflow.
- Credit cards: balance negative = debt; purchases negative; payments are transfers INTO the card (two legs, same transferId).
- Card status uses cutoffDay (fecha de corte) and paymentDueDay (fecha límite de pago); clamp to month length.
- Income should carry areaId so the Wealth engine can compute MXN/hour per activity.
- Keep src/finance/finance.ts pure and unit-tested. Finance XP rewards behavior (logging, paying in full, saving), never amounts.
